    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="70">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 70</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be hergeate. Gyf of ðysum life man gewíte cwydeleas, sy hit ðurh his gymelyste, sy hyt ðurh færlicne deaþ, ðonne ne teo se laford nan mare on his æhte butan his rihtan heregeate.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning heriots. If a man departs from this life intestate, whether through negligence or through sudden death, his lord shall take no more from his property than his legal heriot.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gif hwa cwydeleas of þysum life gewíte, si hit þurh his gymeleaste, si hit þurh færlicne deað, þonne ne teo se hlaford na mare on his æhta butan his rihtan heregeata.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
